-[0m$ [0mgh issue comment 67 --repo promikailamin/mcJava --body "Implemented a config fixer.
-
-- Added \`ConfigFixer\` which runs on server startup after the config is loaded/created.
-- It compares the existing \`config/coreservermod.json\` against the current defaults and adds only missing keys with their default values.
-- Existing values, including unknown/legacy keys, are left unchanged.
-- The file is only rewritten when missing options are actually added; invalid JSON is left untouched.
-- The check is idempotent, so subsequent startups make no changes.
-
-Validation: \`./gradlew build\` passed with Java 25, and a standalone test verified that existing values and legacy keys are preserved while missing defaults are added."
